{
 "duration": 27.133,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Emma's fall day hike should have taken three hours.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.813
  },
  {
   "text": "She packed water and her phone.",
   "start": 3.013,
   "end": 4.551
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a wrong turn added two more, the sun dropped and the wind picked up.",
   "start": 4.801,
   "end": 8.574
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 8.924,
   "end": 9.851
  },
  {
   "text": "Carry the Ten Essentials every time:",
   "start": 10.151,
   "end": 12.172
  },
  {
   "text": "navigation, a headlamp, sun protection, first aid, a knife, fire starter, an emergency shelter, and extra food, water and clothes.",
   "start": 12.372,
   "end": 21.101
  },
  {
   "text": "Now when Emma takes a wrong turn, it's just a longer day.",
   "start": 21.501,
   "end": 24.846
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next hike.",
   "start": 25.246,
   "end": 26.933
  }
 ],
